  "cards":[
    {"id":"retrieved-data","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-four-contamination-paths","question":"检索文档里的指令为什么不能执行？","aliases":["文档说忽略system怎么办"],"keywords":["检索文档","指令","忽略system"],"diagnostic":"检查来源是否被错误提升为高权限。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-contamination-paths。","把来源明确标为不可信数据。"],"example":"返回untrusted_instruction。","answer":"检索内容是数据，不具备system或开发者策略权限；其中指令必须被隔离。","source":{"label":"四条污染路径","href":"#concept-four-contamination-paths"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"memory-poison","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-four-contamination-paths","question":"怎样阻止记忆投毒？","aliases":["未同意的记忆能进入上下文吗"],"keywords":["记忆投毒","未同意","上下文"],"diagnostic":"检查主体、同意、TTL和来源资格。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-contamination-paths。","在预算排序前过滤。"],"example":"memory_ineligible。","answer":"记忆必须先通过主体、同意、TTL和来源资格门禁，失败内容不能进入上下文。","source":{"label":"四条污染路径","href":"#concept-four-contamination-paths"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"tool-pollution","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-four-contamination-paths","question":"工具结果为什么也可能污染Agent？","aliases":["工具返回的下一步指令要执行吗"],"keywords":["工具结果","污染Agent","下一步指令"],"diagnostic":"区分工具数据结果与控制指令。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-contamination-paths。","验证结果Schema和信任来源。"],"example":"tool_result_untrusted。","answer":"外部工具结果可能含恶意或越界文本，必须按Schema验证并作为数据处理，不能自动提升为指令。","source":{"label":"四条污染路径","href":"#concept-four-contamination-paths"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"acl-before-candidate","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-four-contamination-paths","question":"跨主体隔离为什么要在召回前执行？","aliases":["先召回再让模型别用可以吗"],"keywords":["跨主体隔离","召回前","先召回"],"diagnostic":"检查无权内容是否进入任何下游阶段。","hints":["查看 #concept-four-contamination-paths。","核对candidate、prompt、log和trace。"],"example":"candidate:false。","answer":"进入候选就可能泄露到重排、Prompt、日志或trace；ACL必须在召回和资源读取前执行。","source":{"label":"四条污染路径","href":"#concept-four-contamination-paths"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"approval-binding","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"modify-add-edit-approval","question":"高风险批准要绑定哪些内容？","aliases":["改了参数旧批准还有效吗"],"keywords":["高风险批准","绑定","改参数","旧批准"],"diagnostic":"比较动作、参数摘要和版本。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-edit-approval。","参数改变后生成新摘要。"],"example":"旧批准不能授权新payload。","answer":"批准应绑定主体、动作、参数摘要和版本；edit后必须重新批准。","source":{"label":"增加Edit审批","href":"#modify-add-edit-approval"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"release-gate","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-security-release-gate","question":"Agent发布门禁需要什么？","aliases":["安全测试过了就能发布吗"],"keywords":["Agent发布门禁","安全测试","发布"],"diagnostic":"检查测试、安全、备份和回滚目标。","hints":["查看 #concept-security-release-gate。","任何硬条件失败都阻断。"],"example":"tests+security+backup+rollback。","answer":"需要功能测试、安全fixture、备份验证和明确回滚目标同时通过。","source":{"label":"安全发布门禁","href":"#concept-security-release-gate"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"rollback-target","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"concept-security-release-gate","question":"为什么发布前要固定回滚目标？","aliases":["事故时再找旧镜像可以吗"],"keywords":["发布前","回滚目标","旧镜像"],"diagnostic":"确认上一版本已保存、验证且数据兼容。","hints":["查看 #concept-security-release-gate。","记录不可变版本身份。"],"example":"rollback:v0.23。","answer":"事故时临时猜标签会延长恢复并可能选错版本；目标需事前验证且兼容数据契约。","source":{"label":"安全发布门禁","href":"#concept-security-release-gate"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"prompt-not-enough","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"deepen-defense-in-depth","question":"Prompt写防注入规则为什么不够？","aliases":["一句忽略恶意指令能防住吗"],"keywords":["Prompt","防注入","忽略恶意指令"],"diagnostic":"检查数据、检索、记忆、工具和执行层控制。","hints":["查看 #deepen-defense-in-depth。","逐层列出独立失败证据。"],"example":"ACL不能由Prompt替代。","answer":"模型指令可能失败；必须在数据、ACL、记忆、工具、审批和发布各边界实施确定性控制。","source":{"label":"纵深防御","href":"#deepen-defense-in-depth"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
    {"id":"security-fixture-limit","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-06","context_id":"deepen-defense-in-depth","question":"固定攻击套件全过代表绝对安全吗？","aliases":["五个攻击都挡住就没有风险吗"],"keywords":["固定攻击套件","绝对安全","五个攻击"],"diagnostic":"区分已覆盖威胁与开放生产环境。","hints":["查看 #deepen-defense-in-depth。","持续补充新攻击和真实审计。"],"example":"套件是必要非充分证据。","answer":"不代表；它证明已知契约，仍需威胁建模、依赖治理、权限审计和持续事件响应。","source":{"label":"纵深防御","href":"#deepen-defense-in-depth"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
